    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405261
    m_Localized: The mission is passed with a score of {0} or more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405262
    m_Localized: Produce at least {0} units ({1})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405263
    m_Localized: Defects at most {0}%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405264
    m_Localized: Shorten load paths on the floor by {0}%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405265
    m_Localized: 'No warehouse overflow (overflow days: {0})'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405266
    m_Localized: At most {0} returned defective units
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405267
    m_Localized: Downtime from breakdowns and maintenance at most {0} h
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405268
    m_Localized: Market share at least {0}% ({1})
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405269
    m_Localized: Win a federation tender and fulfil the contract on time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405270
    m_Localized: The first shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405271
    m_Localized: Build a shop and make your first doboks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405272
    m_Localized: You have an empty shop and UZS 80 M. Paint cutting and sewing zones, place machines, hire a cutter, a seamstress and a laborer, order cotton and thread, set a plan and a price. The goal is at least 250 doboks in two months without excess defects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405273
    m_Localized: "Tip: drag the mouse to paint a zone, place each machine inside its zone facing an aisle. The Staff screen has an \u201CAssign operators\u201D button."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405274
    m_Localized: Logistics and warehouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405275
    m_Localized: Rearrange machines so loads travel less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405276
    m_Localized: 'The shop works, but machines stand at the far ends of their zones and laborers waste time walking. Move machines closer to storage and to each other, set up racks, the feed side and the transport batch. The goal: shorten load paths by 30% and avoid warehouse overflow without losing output.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405277
    m_Localized: 'Tip: turn on the spaghetti diagram on the Shop floor screen, red cells show the busiest aisles. The Move tool relocates the selected machine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405278
    m_Localized: Quality
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405279
    m_Localized: Cut defects and stop returns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405280
    m_Localized: 'The shop was built on the cheap: no QC table and no inspector, and customers return defective goods. Place a QC table, hire an inspector, turn on incoming inspection, choose what to do with detected defects, train people. The goal: defects at most 2.5% and no returns in two months.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405281
    m_Localized: 'Tip: QC finds defects before they are sold, and incoming inspection keeps bad material out. Tired and inexperienced people make more mistakes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405282
    m_Localized: Equipment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405283
    m_Localized: The machines are worn out, keep them from breaking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405284
    m_Localized: 'You bought a shop with old machines: their condition is about 1%. Without a mechanic no planned maintenance happens, and a breakdown stops a machine for a long time. Hire a mechanic, set a maintenance interval, add IoT sensors and predictive maintenance if you can afford them. Molding and helmets unlock here. The goal: at most 2 hours of downtime from breakdowns and maintenance in three months.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405285
    m_Localized: 'Tip: with one or two shifts the mechanic does maintenance between shifts with no downtime. An interval of 1 operation sends a machine to maintenance right away, then set the usual interval back.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793856
    m_Localized: Market and rivals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793857
    m_Localized: "Win market share from Daebo and Ab\u0131das."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793858
    m_Localized: "Rivals have entered the market: Daebo sells expensive quality goods, Ab\u0131das sells cheap. Buyers choose by price, quality and reputation. Manage prices and plans, invest in advertising, sponsor tournaments, sign an ambassador. The goal: at least 33% market share in the last month."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793859
    m_Localized: 'Tip: when you run out of stock, sales go to the rivals. Watch lost sales on the Sales screen.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793860
    m_Localized: Contracts and growth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793861
    m_Localized: Win a federation tender and deliver on time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793862
    m_Localized: 'The regional taekwondo federation has announced a tender for 200 doboks with delivery within two months. Bid in the first month, scale up production, take a loan if needed, certify your products, adopt digital modules. The goal: fulfil the contract with no delay.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793863
    m_Localized: "Tip: bids are accepted until the end of the month and the best score wins \u2014 price, reputation and quality history. Contract deliveries come before retail."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793864
    m_Localized: Three-year results
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793865
    m_Localized: Ranking by capitalization. You can keep playing with no time limit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
